  "result": "Fixed. `IntRange._clamp` in `src/click/types.py` returned `bound - dir`, but `dir` is already the direction to move (1 for min, -1 for max), so it now returns `bound + dir`. `IntRange(0, min_open=True, clamp=True).convert('0', ...)` gives 1.\n\nI added four regression cases to the clamp parametrize list in `tests/test_types.py`:\n- `min_open` at the bound (`\"0\"` \u2192 1)\n- `min_open` below the bound (`\"-5\"` \u2192 1)\n- `max_open` at the bound (`\"5\"` \u2192 4)\n- `max_open` above the bound (`\"10\"` \u2192 4)\n\n`python -m pytest tests/test_types.py -q` reports 45 passed, 2 skipped.",
